            <title>[IGNITE-1536] Duplicate notification in continuous query</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-1536</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Scenario is the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Start first node with a &lt;tt&gt;REPLICATED&lt;/tt&gt; cache.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Execute non-local continuous query.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Start second node.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Do several puts for different keys.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Some of the notifications are duplicated.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
